You're being very formal.

56
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:36,156
Aren't I?

57
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:38,032
I had the same experience with my father when I was 21,

58
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:43,593
And since my life has changed so much since then,

59
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:48,635
I have to approach things cautiously.

60
