Good night.

1526
01:43:20,760 --> 01:43:23,149
It was a bad day.

1527
01:43:23,280 --> 01:43:25,635
It was really bad.

1528
01:43:25,800 --> 01:43:28,439
I got fired.

1529
01:43:29,280 --> 01:43:31,430
And I killed someone.

1530
01:43:37,120 --> 01:43:39,270
Now that's a really bad day.

1531
01:43:39,480 --> 01:43:41,471
- It was awful. - Yeah.

1532
01:43:42,440 --> 01:43:44,749
That must have been the worst day of your life.

1533
01:43:45,320 --> 01:43:46,958
I'm so sorry.

1534
01:43:51,880 --> 01:43:55,475
Some days are just enough with only one occurrence.

1535
01:43:56,320 --> 01:43:57,469
Are you okay?

1536
01:44:49,000 --> 01:44:51,878
Are we ready?

1537
01:44:52,280 --> 01:44:55,716
Of course not. It's a terrible day.

1538
01:44:56,560 --> 01:44:59,358
Just a moment.

1539
01:45:21,720 --> 01:45:23,711
That's brilliant.

1540
01:45:24,640 --> 01:45:29,316
Dickens has a great sense of humor.

1541
01:45:30,240 --> 01:45:31,992
Where are you coming from?

1542
